OL,3,GNEWSABlack Country derby 'passes
OL,4,Awithout incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Black Country football derby between
OL,7,FWolves and West Brom passed off without
OL,8,Fmajor incident, West Midlands Police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAn 18-year-old man was arrested after a
OL,12,Fnew football mural near Molineux in
OL,13,FWolverhampton was vandalised with blue
OL,14,Fpaint hours after it was unveiled on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
