OL,3,GNEWSABlack Country derby 'passes
OL,4,Awithout incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother man, aged 52, was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of a public order offence
OL,8,Ffollowing reports of disorder after
OL,9,Flast month's Wolves match against Stoke
OL,10,FCity while three other men, aged
OL,11,Fbetween 16 and 63, were arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of other offences including
OL,13,Fsexual assault and racially aggravated
OL,14,Fpublic order.
OL,16,FWolves beat West Bromwich Albion 1-0 in
OL,17,Fthe match at Molineux on Sunday.
